msgstr ""

#: ../../source/database/results.rst:149
msgid "Custom Result Objects"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/database/results.rst:151
msgid ""
"You can have the results returned as an instance of a custom class "
"instead of a ``stdClass`` or array, as the ``getResult()`` and "
"``getResultArray()`` methods allow. If the class is not already loaded "
"into memory, the Autoloader will attempt to load it. The object will have"
" all values returned from the database set as properties. If these have "
"been declared and are non-public then you should provide a ``__set()`` "
"method to allow them to be set."
msgstr ""

